on, and assuming ‘0’ refers to her, the answer is correct.)*\n\n---\n\n✅ **CORRECTED FINAL ANSWER: YES — the girl with the pink top with roses on it is the one in the online relationship.**"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1084.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1085.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1087.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1088.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1089.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1090.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1091.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1092.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1093.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1094.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1095.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1096.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1097.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1107.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1108.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1109.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1110.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1111.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1112.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1113.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1114.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1115.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1116.jpg', '/mnt/